---
import LegalPage from '@/components/sections/LegalPage.astro';
import { site, contact } from '@/config/site';
---

<LegalPage title="Privacy" description={`How ${site.name} handles personal information.`} updated="September 2026">
  <p>This notice explains what personal information {site.legalName} collects through this website, why, and what your rights are.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>When you send an enquiry we receive the details you enter: your name, email address, and optionally your phone number, the vehicle you are interested in and your message.</p>
  <h2>Why we use it</h2>
  <p>We use these details only to reply to your enquiry and, if you become a customer, to prepare the paperwork for your purchase. We do not sell your information and do not use it for advertising.</p>
  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>Enquiries that do not lead to a purchase are deleted after twelve months. Purchase records are kept for as long as the law requires.</p>
  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This website does not use tracking cookies. If you add analytics, describe them here.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you by writing to <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
